          kind: 'workflow-builder',
          title: 'Build a weekly report workflow',
          prompt: 'Choose and order the steps for a virtual assistant who prepares a weekly sales report from a shop\'s order sheet. Use AI for the draft, keep private details out of the tool, and keep the checking and the judgment with the person.',
          situation: 'A virtual assistant prepares a weekly sales report for a small shop owner from the shop\'s order spreadsheet. The sheet has customer names, phone numbers and addresses next to the sales figures. She wants AI to draft the summary, but the owner relies on the numbers being right.',
